---
import SEOHead from '../components/SEOHead.astro';
import LegalBody from '../components/pages/LegalBody.astro';

const lang = 'en';
---

<html lang={lang}>
	<head>
		<SEOHead
			title="Privacy Policy | Sota Travel Zakynthos"
			description="How Sota Travel Zakynthos collects, uses and protects your personal data when you contact us or book a boat rental."
			lang={lang}
			basePath="/privacy-policy"
		/>
	</head>
	<LegalBody lang={lang} basePath="/privacy-policy" title="Privacy Policy" updated="July 2026">
		<p>
			Sota Travel Zakynthos ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your
			personal data. This policy explains what information we collect when you use
			<a href="https://rentaboatzakynthos.com">rentaboatzakynthos.com</a> or contact us, why we collect it,
			and the rights you have. By using our website you agree to the practices described here.
		</p>

		<h2>Information we collect</h2>
		<p>We only collect what we need to answer your enquiry and arrange your boat rental:</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Contact details</strong> you provide — name, email address, phone number and the content of your message.</li>
			<li><strong>Booking details</strong> — the dates, trip type and any preferences you share with us.</li>
			<li><strong>Technical data</strong> — IP address, browser and device type, and anonymous usage statistics collected through cookies and analytics.</li>
		</ul>
		<p>We do not collect payment card details on this website, and we do not knowingly collect sensitive personal data.</p>

		<h2>How we use your data</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>To respond to your enquiries and provide quotes.</li>
			<li>To arrange, confirm and manage your boat rental or cruise.</li>
			<li>To improve our website and understand how visitors use it.</li>
			<li>To meet our legal and accounting obligations.</li>
		</ul>
		<p>We never sell your data. We only share it with trusted service providers (for example our hosting and analytics providers) who process it on our behalf, and with authorities where required by law.</p>

		<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
		<p>
			We keep your information only for as long as needed to serve you and to comply with legal
			obligations, after which it is securely deleted.
		</p>

		<h2>Your rights</h2>
		<p>Under the GDPR you have the right to access, correct, delete or restrict the processing of your data, to object to processing, and to data portability. You may also lodge a complaint with the Hellenic Data Protection Authority. To exercise any of these rights, contact us using the details below.</p>

		<h2>Cookies</h2>
		<p>Our website uses cookies to function correctly and to measure traffic. You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings. For more detail, see our <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>

		<h2>Contact us</h2>
		<p>
			For any privacy question or request, email <a href="mailto:sotatravel1@gmail.com">sotatravel1@gmail.com</a>
			or call <a href="tel:+306987931327">+30 698 793 1327</a>. Sota Travel Zakynthos, Zakynthos Marina, Greece.
		</p>

		<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
		<p>We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a new "last updated" date.</p>
	</LegalBody>
</html>
